  "docs_notes": [
    "B5d ports the last two Stage 5 audit catalogue rows. Audit is opt-in through instance-owned application registration and package functions; no Query/Table methods added.",
    "Document Automatic/Exclude/Redact, immutable model-owned policies, touched-only update/soft-delete/restore capture, complete create/delete snapshots, stored codecs and transactional rollback.",
    "Historical readers preserve field omission, model absence, SQL NULL and redaction. Capture/redaction and decoder ownership are shared with the old API; ordinary read footprints remain unchanged.",
    "No manifests, OpenAPI, TypeScript, datatables, relation writes or extension slots changed."
  ],
